1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,457
From the air, it's only forest.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,160
But laser light slips between the leaves,

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,160
and some of it reaches the ground.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,692
Remove every return that hit a tree.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,910
And the ground remembers.

6
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:20,810
Stone walls. Old fields, under the trees.

7
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:24,610
We traced 3.4 km of wall.

8
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:27,648
Just over half a metre high.

9
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:33,110
In 1870, two-thirds of Ashford was farmland.

10
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:37,210
By 2006, four-fifths was forest.

11
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:39,866
The forest kept the map.
